### Variables
@vidingestHost = localhost
@vidingestPort = 8051
@vidingestBase = http://{{vidingestHost}}:{{vidingestPort}}/vidingest
@vidingestMcpPort = 8055
@vidingestMcpBase = http://{{vidingestHost}}:{{vidingestMcpPort}}/vidingest

@videoUrl = https://www.youtube.com/shorts/JgOklCLhpPo
@videoId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@pipelineId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Swagger / OpenAPI
# {{vidingestBase}}/swagger-ui/index.html
# {{vidingestBase}}/swagger-ui.html
GET {{vidingestBase}}/v3/api-docs

### Readiness
GET {{vidingestBase}}/api/v1/health/ready

### MCP SSE transport (smoke)
GET {{vidingestMcpBase}}/sse
Accept: text/event-stream

### Download to DB (sync)
POST {{vidingestBase}}/api/v1/videos/download
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "{{videoUrl}}",
  "diskOnly": false,
  "progress": false
}

### Download to disk only
POST {{vidingestBase}}/api/v1/videos/download
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "{{videoUrl}}",
  "diskOnly": true,
  "progress": false
}

### List videos (paged)
GET {{vidingestBase}}/api/v1/videos?status=ALL&page=0&size=25

### Get video
GET {{vidingestBase}}/api/v1/videos/{{videoId}}

### Delete video
DELETE {{vidingestBase}}/api/v1/videos/{{videoId}}

### Create pipeline run (async)
POST {{vidingestBase}}/api/v1/pipelines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "urls": ["{{videoUrl}}"],
  "skipPhases": ["DIARIZE", "FRAME_SAMPLE", "OCR", "KNOWLEDGE"]
}

### List pipeline runs (paged)
GET {{vidingestBase}}/api/v1/pipelines?status=ALL&page=0&size=25

### Get pipeline run
GET {{vidingestBase}}/api/v1/pipelines/{{pipelineId}}

### Retry pipeline run (async)
POST {{vidingestBase}}/api/v1/pipelines/{{pipelineId}}/retry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skipPhases": ["DIARIZE", "FRAME_SAMPLE", "OCR", "KNOWLEDGE"]
}

### Retry a single failed run item (async)
POST {{vidingestBase}}/api/v1/pipelines/{{pipelineId}}/items/{{itemId}}/retry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skipPhases": ["DIARIZE", "FRAME_SAMPLE", "OCR", "KNOWLEDGE"]
}

### Search (409/503 unless semantic is enabled + provider exists)
GET {{vidingestBase}}/api/v1/search?query=hello&limit=5

